          "body": "`_parse_params` accepts dispositions from the entire catalog, while this lookup checks only that the item exists. Consequently, a collaborator can successfully propose `billed` for the test Close COGS KPI, which permits only `reassigned` and `not_cogs`. Applying that proposal fails in `_state_failure`. Validate the proposal against the item's KPI before recording it so the API does not accept actions its owner cannot apply.",
