          "category": "race-condition",
          "title": "Atomically reserve the invoice before charging",
          "body": "Two overlapping requests can both pass `find_active_payment_by_invoice`, the unknown-outcome check, and the Braintree order search before either reaches `_record`. Both then execute `_charge`, charging the full invoice balance twice. The modal lock only covers one mounted component, so requests from separate staff sessions remain exposed. Add an atomic invoice/environment reservation before the checks and hold it through charging and outcome persistence; a competing request must be refused before contacting Braintree.",
